.TH MANTA-URL 1 "manta-url v1.0.0" "Manta Tools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
manta-url \- URL shortener and validator for the command line
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B url <command> [options] <url>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validate URL format, expand shortened URLs (follow redirects), and extract URL components (scheme, host, path, params, query, fragment). Zero external dependencies.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B validate <url>
Check if a URL is well-formed
.TP
.B expand <url>
Follow redirects to resolve shortened URLs
.TP
.B parse <url>
Extract and display URL components
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --version
Show version and exit
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Validate a URL
.B url validate https://example.com
.TP
Expand a shortened URL
.B url expand https://bit.ly/3abc123
.TP
Parse URL components
.B url parse https://example.com/path?q=hello#section
.SH EXIT CODES
.TP
.B 0
Success
.TP
.B 1
Invalid URL or error
